    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43910" root="&#xA;                        نزع&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَزَّاعٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Dragging much,</i> or <i>forcibly:</i> see Kur,
lxx. 16. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العرْقُ نَزَّاعٌ</span> (see Freytag's Arab. Prov.,
ii. 168) is probably similar to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العِرْقُ دسَّاسٌ</span>, and
means <i>The radical,</i> or <i>ancestral,</i> or <i>hereditary,
quality is wont to return to its usual possessor:</i>
or it may mean, <i>is wont to draw.</i>
